<title>USA: Intermagnetic acquires MAI for $12 mln.</title>
<headline>Intermagnetic acquires MAI for $12 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LATHAM, N.Y. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intermagnetics General Corp said Wednesday it has acquired Medical Advances Inc for $12 million in cash and stock.</p>
<p>Medical Advances spplies Radio Frequency Coils generally used for clinical diagnostic magnetic resonance imaging, said the company.</p>
<p>Intermagnetics develops and makes superconducting LTS and HTS magnets, wire and cable, as well as associated low temperature refrigeration equipment.</p>
